# PostgreSQL Blockchain Extension

{info:title=Enterprise Documentation}
This is the comprehensive documentation for the PostgreSQL Blockchain Extension - a powerful system that adds immutable, tamper-evident storage capabilities to PostgreSQL through cryptographic hash chaining and global counter management.
