## What is the PostgreSQL Blockchain Extension?

The PostgreSQL Blockchain Extension transforms PostgreSQL into a blockchain-enabled database system, providing:

{info:title=Key Features}
* **🔒 Immutable Storage**: Once data is inserted, it cannot be modified or deleted
* **🔗 Cryptographic Integrity**: SHA-256 hash chains ensure tamper detection  
* **🔢 Sequential Ordering**: Global counter system provides unique sequencing
* **👁️ Transparent Access**: Standard SQL interface with automatic system columns
* **🛡️ Multi-layer Protection**: Defense-in-depth security architecture
{info}

